<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS3" title="In 5.2. Results and Analysis ‣ 5. Experiments ‣ Are LLMs Better GNN Helpers? Rethinking Robust Graph Learning under Deficiencies with Iterative Refinement" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.2.3 </span>Robustness under Compound Deficiencies (RQ3)</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS4" title="In 5.2. Results and Analysis ‣ 5. Experiments ‣ Are LLMs Better GNN Helpers? Rethinking Robust Graph Learning under Deficiencies with Iterative Refinement" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.2.4 </span>Robust Contrastive Learning with R2CL (RQ4)</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS5" title="In 5.2. Results and Analysis ‣ 5. Experiments ‣ Are LLMs Better GNN Helpers? Rethinking Robust Graph Learning under Deficiencies with Iterative Refinement" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.2.5 </span>Effect of Hyperparameter <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
